entityDescription:
Core activity of Atomki:
- conducting basic and applied research in nuclear physics, atomic physics and particle physics;
- application of knowledge and methods from the field of physics in other disciplines (material science and material research, earth sciences and environmental research, medical-biological research) and in practice;
- developing methods and tools for basic and applied research.
Other tasks related to the research activities of Atomki:
- disseminating scientific knowledge in the context of its core research activity, publishing scientific, technical and educational publications;
- facilitating scientific activity in Hungarian;
- cooperating with domestic research centres and research institutes and conducting joint researches with them; maintaining and establih contacts with scientific institutions of other countries and international scienfitic societies; promoting the exposure of Hungarian scientific research within the international scientific community;
- organising domestic and international scientific programs and conferences, inviting tenders;
- encouraging and facilitating the utilisation of scientific research results in the social and economic life;
- cooperating with higher education institutions in teaching, and carrying out joint research, training and advanced training activities;
- operating specialised libraries.

